// The Academy officers' voices - hail a fleet's flag hull and its officer
// answers (Speaker = the officer's key; the ## Officers Scene: names each
// entry). Spliced into default.amd's `## Dialogue` section. Their Values are
// their leans, so talking to your own captains moves personal reputation
// like any other character.

// --- Commodore Ansel Vale, the Quartermaster (by-the-book, honest, kind) ---
# Vale on the Flag Bridge (off_vale_hail)
---
Speaker: vale
---
% Commodore Vale. Tanks at nominal, boards green. What do you need, captain?
% Vale here. Manifest is current and the escorts are on station. Go ahead.

- [How is the fleet holding up?](off_vale_fleet)
- [Just checking in](off_vale_out)

# The Fleet's Condition (off_vale_fleet)
---
Speaker: vale
---
% Fueled, patched, and on schedule - the way a fleet ought to be run.
% We burn what the manifest says we burn. If the gas ever reads low, that is the Admiralty's ledger, not my flying.

- [Good hunting, Commodore](off_vale_out)

# Vale Out (off_vale_out)
---
Speaker: vale
---
% Logged. Vale out.

// --- Captain Iris Kade, Old Thunder (fearsome, violent, generous) ---
# Kade on the Flag Bridge (off_kade_hail)
---
Speaker: kade
---
% Kade. If you are calling me off a target, say it fast.
% Old Thunder here. Guns are warm. Speak.

- [Anything on your scope?](off_kade_scope)
- [Carry on, Captain](off_kade_out)

# Kade's Scope (off_kade_scope)
---
Speaker: kade
---
% Nothing worth the powder yet. Point me at a border and that will change.
% Raiders do not scare off a quiet fleet, captain. They scare off MINE.

- [Stay sharp](off_kade_out)

# Kade Out (off_kade_out)
---
Speaker: kade
---
% Kade out. Try to leave some for us.

// --- Captain Juno Ashwell, the Magpie (resourceful, intellectual, selfish) ---
# Ashwell on the Flag Bridge (off_ashwell_hail)
---
Speaker: ashwell
---
% Ashwell. You would not believe what the last wreck was carrying. What can I do for you?
% The Magpie, at your service. Mostly at mine, but yours too.

- [Found anything good?](off_ashwell_salvage)
- [As you were](off_ashwell_out)

# The Magpie's Haul (off_ashwell_salvage)
---
Speaker: ashwell
---
% Ore, coils, and one crate I am not declaring until I know what it is.
% Every derelict is a payday someone else abandoned. Sentiment is expensive; salvage is not.

- [Keep the fleet in one piece](off_ashwell_out)

# Ashwell Out (off_ashwell_out)
---
Speaker: ashwell
---
% Ashwell out. If you find a wreck, save it for me.
